7a7486d564b202a5192e)\n- Not reproducible in 4.8.dev2 (7220d456d)\n- Regression from #116490\n\n```\nfbf2ad2ef8173d7694f6dac93fc3e2ed9397f1c7 is the first bad commit\ncommit fbf2ad2ef8173d7694f6dac93fc3e2ed9397f1c7\nAuthor: kit <kitbdev@gmail.com>\nDate:   Mon Feb 9 11:43:02 2026 -0500\n\n    Extract DocumentList from ScriptEditor\n    Organize tab changing logic\n\n editor/script/script_editor_base.cpp   |   18 +-\n editor/script/script_editor_base.h     |    4 +-\n editor/script/script_editor_plugin.cpp | 1598 ++++++++++++++++----------------\n editor/script/script_editor_plugin.h   |  102 +-\n editor/script/script_text_editor.cpp   |   12 +-\n editor/script/script_text_editor.h     |    1 +\n editor/shader/shader_editor_plugin.cpp |   20 +-\n editor/shader/shader_text_editor.cpp   |   12 +-\n editor/shader/shader_text_editor.h     |    1 +\n 9 files changed, 909 insertions(+), 859 deletions(-)\n```\n\nCC @kitbdev \n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.dev (fbf2ad2ef) - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9227) - AMD Ryzen 5 5600H with Radeon Graphics (12 threads) - 31.34 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nBug identified by YeldhamDev\n\nAfter restarting the editor, docs of custom scripts turn into these \"Unknown Help Class\" tabs. In 4.7 they close on restart, but after #116490 they become the \"Unknown Help Class\".\n\n<img width=\"908\" height=\"485\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/297f5a7a-3f5d-44f6-92bd-19d6e8e76716\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open the MRP\n2. Open the Script Editor\n3. Press \"Search Help\"\n4. Type \"new_script\"\n5. Open \"new_script.gd\"\n6. Restart the editor (Project > Reload current project)\n7. Open the Script Editor\n8. Look at the tabs\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30797804/mrp.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122172/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122172/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}